AUDIO: 'I\'m making. And this is running on Craya 2 Turbo. So what you\'ll be doing is feeding it a reference photo and then it runs that image through Gemma 4, which is basically just a local language model that has built-in image analysis and a system prompt here that forces a'

[03:35] [scene:talk]
