VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'into generating all 50 of my data set images. The data set generator that I\'m using right now is the YouTube friendly version. I\'ve got a separate version which will be set up by default for you guys in the free workflow section of my Discord with more explicit preset'

[08:03] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
