[13:04] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '$5. So, I\'m going to deploy this and then this is going to take a few minutes to initialize here. So, my pod is spun up and ready to go. So, what I\'m going to do is open the AI toolkit UI. And for the password, you\'ll be prompted for a'

